Package: nct6687d-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS driver for Nuvoton NCT6687-R hardware monitoring
 This package provides the out-of-tree nct6687 kernel module through DKMS.
 It exposes supported voltage, temperature, fan-speed, and PWM sensors
 through the Linux hardware monitoring subsystem.
